{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Trigonometry)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Trigonometry)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/303cc43adf130b532ddc68451d4f73ef052e214c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A =45^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e811fd34474288e886811b34acff506440506fe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle B =30^{\\circ}$\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />. A line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> \nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79c92d36e4735938500f3b33c57da1879e97ebf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADE =60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />, divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> into two pieces of equal area. \n(Note: the figure may not be accurate; perhaps <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3a4ec0df571e719bd3f1d7e00bf71fc55ba2b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c5e6c45871994df1a1724de10b8cd84c9a9bea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC.)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" />\nThe ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b95247b914fe5b0405d98455aa0ecccf775bd641.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AD}{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"31\" height=\"38\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/135a648963b48464cdd989019e3de4847a416079.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size((220)); draw((0,0)--(20,0)--(7,6)--cycle); draw((6,6)--(10,-1)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (0,0), W); label(&quot;B&quot;, (20,0), E); label(&quot;C&quot;, (7,6), NE); label(&quot;D&quot;, (9.5,-1), W); label(&quot;E&quot;, (5.9, 6.1), SW); label(&quot;$45^{\\circ}$&quot;, (2.5,.5)); label(&quot;$60^{\\circ}$&quot;, (7.8,.5)); label(&quot;$30^{\\circ}$&quot;, (16.5,.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"368\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/5/0552faf8dc8fb3fefe89900cae35dfc47f52ce06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2}{2+\\sqrt{2}} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{6}}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"488\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First we show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, as in the given figure, by demonstrating that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec59b9ad9387edf6f7eaf639f2115368b16c6fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E = C$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db041d9c0fda44cf24b4f4ae7f02243ef2ea7f92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADE$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> has more than half the area, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is too far to the right. Specifically, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec59b9ad9387edf6f7eaf639f2115368b16c6fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E = C$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and drop an altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> that meets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Without loss of generality, assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db920c16c37f9ecd5503cc0b8f06f924bc6f9ba5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/606dce479ab5ae5c77a2efe5966a680cae85164d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\text{Area} \\ \\triangle EAD}{\\text{Area} \\ \\triangle EAB} = \\frac{AD}{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"159\" height=\"39\" /> (as they have the same height, and area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> times the product of base and height), which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/a/dba82a5ea3be70d0dc381def6e3647fa78a7cc4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1 + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}}{1 + \\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} &gt; \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"147\" height=\"47\" />, as required. Thus we must move <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> to the left, scaling <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a7f8da13ae82b5e61ba82b102b403cd427f59a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle EAD$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> by a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/7/72765ebeedfae962263033645f644e5d624a6c9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Area} \\ \\triangle EAD = \\frac{1}{2} \\ \\text{Area} \\ \\triangle CAB \\implies \\frac{1}{2}k^{2}(1+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}) = \\frac{1}{4}(1+\\sqrt{3}) \\implies k^{2} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\implies k = (\\frac{3}{4})^{\\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"741\" height=\"45\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/8/388278a98681d4d01abcd946122c3470e490774c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AD}{AB} = \\frac{k(1+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}})}{1+\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{k}{\\sqrt{3}} = (\\frac{3}{4})^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\times (\\frac{1}{9})^{\\frac{1}{4}} = (\\frac{1}{12})^{\\frac{1}{4}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"444\" height=\"47\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Trigonometry.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Trigonometry)\">Solution 2 (Trigonometry)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Trigonometry)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The proof of why point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is the same as Solution 1.\n</p><p>We have:\n\\begin{align}\n\\text{Area} \\ \\triangle AED &amp;= \\text{Area} \\ \\triangle CDB\\\\\n\\text{Area} \\ \\triangle AED &amp;= \\text{Area} \\ \\triangle ABC - \\text{Area} \\ \\triangle AED\\\\\n2\\cdot\\text{Area} \\ \\triangle AED &amp;= \\text{Area} \\ \\triangle ABC\n\\end{align}\nSince the area of a triangle can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/439d2e4ffc25bc4a5e08d5d10fc5201514529776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac 12ab\\sin C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" />, we have\n\\begin{align}\n2 \\cdot \\dfrac 12 AE\\cdot AD \\cdot \\sin45^\\circ &amp;= \\dfrac 12 AC\\cdot AB \\cdot \\sin45^\\circ\\\\\n2 \\cdot AE \\cdot AD = AC \\cdot AB\n\\end{align}\n</p><p>Now, by Law of Sines, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f54dacc00d3100f3ae77541687a06dffb2d80273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = \\dfrac{AD \\cdot \\sin 60^\\circ}{\\sin 75^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"152\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10c46726b601dfef8418ce1f36624b2c9d55f3f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = \\dfrac{AB \\cdot \\sin 30 ^\\circ}{\\sin 75^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"151\" height=\"39\" />. Thus, by substitution we have\n\\begin{align}\n2 \\cdot AD \\cdot \\dfrac{AD \\cdot \\sin 60^\\circ}{\\sin 75^\\circ} &amp;= AB \\cdot \\dfrac{AB \\cdot \\sin 30 ^\\circ}{\\sin 75^\\circ}\\\\\n2 \\cdot AD^2 \\cdot \\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}2 &amp;= AB^2 \\cdot \\dfrac 12\\\\\n\\dfrac{AD^2}{AB^2} &amp;= \\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{3}}\\\\\n\\dfrac{AD}{AB} &amp;= \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{12}}\n\\end{align}\nThe answer is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180104\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 268/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2462/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 157/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8082/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.617      1 -total\n 57.41%    7.243      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 40.01%    5.048      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13724:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017180104 and revision id 249546. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}